## Verdict: **APPLY**

Files read: `dashboard/static/tavern_brawl.html` (366 lines — the live file; `dashboard/static/games/tavern_brawl.html` confirmed nonexistent), draft `watch/inbox/games_polish/p09-tavern-brawl.md`. Also compared copies: `site/dist/games/tavern_brawl.html` is **byte-identical** to live; `dist_audit/…/tavern_brawl.html` is a stale older build (same bug at its `:281`).

### Citation audit — all verified correct
- **Path note**: correct; only `dashboard/static/tavern_brawl.html` + 2 copies exist (glob).
- **Juice #1** `:302`: exact string `H - 80 - f.y*0 + (floaters.indexOf(f))*-0` — both `*0`, so every floater draws at x=12, y=H-80=600. **Confirmed.**
- **Juice #2** `:211` `continue` skips both move and the offscreen cull at `:230`; bubbles (`:132`, dmg 0) accumulate → `:335` `projectiles.length > 0` keeps `shouldStep` true forever → SUPERHOT never freezes again. **Confirmed.**
- **Juice #3** `:233-236` ttl only for `kind==="salt"`; `ttl:600` traps from `:181` (no `kind`) and god-trap `:327` never expire; trap scan at `:170-175` runs per ractor per frame. **Confirmed.**
- **Juice #4** `r.headLine` referenced at `:225`, never assigned anywhere (grep: only occurrence). **Confirmed** — one overstatement: "no … shake anywhere" ignores the GORN knockback drift `RAGDOLL` at `:222-224/:144-151`; there is no *flash*, but there is knockback.
- **Difficulty #1** `:122` targets only other RACTORS; no player entity/HP/win. **Confirmed.**
- **Difficulty #2** trap `dmg` written `:181/:188/:327`, never read (grep `t.dmg`: zero hits); only salt slow `:170-175`. **Confirmed.**
- **Difficulty #3** `:240` `12*3` = 36 ticks × 33 ms ≈ 1.19 s vs comment `:237` "12s later"; `12*30` = 360 ticks ≈ 11.9 s. **Confirmed.**
- **Difficulty #4** `:321` `agit+8` ≤260 px, fires at `:198`. **Confirmed.**
- **Onboarding #1-4**: HUD `:17` vs random-kind click `:346-347`; keys gated to 60 px of ghost `:355`; P/Q deltas −14/−8 at `:90-91`; `superhot` never drawn (`:325` toggle has no indicator); `#verdict` div `:20` is never populated. **All confirmed.**

### Why APPLY (not ADJUST)
- Insertion point exact: replace `:298-304`, between `combatLog.forEach` (`:297`) and `#cast` update (`:305`).
- Geometry checks out: newest at `H-96` = **584**, 15 px stack, cap 6 → topmost y=509; no clash with combat-log box (y ≤ 108), `#cast` (top), empty `#verdict`, or `#jacket` (bottom ~8 px).
- Fade `Math.max(0, Math.min(1,(150-f.t)/40))` matches the original curve, floater removal at `t>150` (`:246`); no new `rngDraw` (replay contract at `:56-60` untouched); no name collisions inside `draw()`; safe on empty `floaters`.
- Nit only (non-blocking): with >6 floaters the 7th arrival pops the oldest line instantly instead of fading it out — cosmetic, accepted under the 6-line bound.

### Final code (exact replacement for `dashboard/static/tavern_brawl.html` lines 298–304)

**Anchor before** (`:297`):
```js
  combatLog.forEach((t, i) => { cx.fillStyle = i ? "#4f7a70" : "#ffd76a"; cx.fillText(t.slice(0, 46), W-322, 44 + i*14); });
```
**Remove** (`:298-304`):
```js
  // dialogue
  for (const f of floaters){
    cx.globalAlpha = Math.min(1, (150-f.t)/40);
    cx.fillStyle = "#ffd76a"; cx.font = "12px Consolas";
    cx.fillText(f.text.slice(0, 110), 12, H - 80 - f.y*0 + (floaters.indexOf(f))*-0 );
    cx.globalAlpha = 1;
  }
```
**Insert:**
```js
  // dialogue — newest at the bottom, older lines stack upward, never overlap
  const fStart = Math.max(0, floaters.length - 6);   // cap: 6 visible lines
  for (let i = fStart; i < floaters.length; i++){
    const f = floaters[i];
    const newest = i === floaters.length - 1;
    const fade = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (150 - f.t) / 40));
    cx.globalAlpha = fade * (newest ? 1 : 0.7);
    cx.fillStyle = newest ? "#ffd76a" : "#8fb3a9";
    cx.font = newest ? "bold 12px Consolas" : "12px Consolas";
    cx.fillText(f.text.slice(0, 110), 12, H - 96 - (floaters.length - 1 - i) * 15);
    cx.globalAlpha = 1;
  }
```
